    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "发长彦突然警觉，扭头一看，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hatsunagahiko suddenly grew alert and turned his head to look,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那只满肚子坏水的土蜘蛛不知何时弄来一块巨大的石头堵住了洞口。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and saw that the wicked earth spider had somehow brought over a huge rock and blocked the cave entrance.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "并且志得意满的对着石头，拍手称赞：“",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then, brimming with satisfaction, it faced the stone, clapped its hands, and cried out in praise, \"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你们咎由自取！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You brought this on yourselves!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "如此一来，用不了一个月，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now, in less than a month,",
          "g": "adverbial"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "你们就都饿得皮包骨头，死在里面啦！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "you will all be starved down to skin and bones and die in there!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00299",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "我的计划完美吧！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My plan is perfect, isn't it!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
